msgid "Audited Ballots"
msgstr "Papeletas auditadas"

#: helios/templates/election_audited_ballots.html:9
msgid ""
"When you prepare a ballot with Helios, you immediately receive a ballot "
"tracker. Before you choose to cast that ballot, you have the option to ask "
"Helios to \"break open\" that encrypted ballot and verify that Helios "
"encrypted your ballot correctly. Once that's done, you can post that opened "
"ballot here, on the audited ballots' list, for everyone to verify (your "
"identity is not included). Once you've done this, you have to re-encrypt "
"your choices and obtain a different ballot tracker. This helps reduce the "
"chance that someone might coerce you to vote differently from your true "
"choice."
msgstr ""
"Cuando prepara una papeleta con Helios, recibe inmediatamente un código de "
"seguimiento. Antes de decidir emitir esa papeleta, tiene la opción de "
"pedirle a Helios que \"abra\" esa papeleta cifrada y verifique que Helios "
"cifró su papeleta correctamente. Una vez hecho esto, puede publicar esa "
"papeleta abierta aquí, en la lista de papeletas auditadas, para que todos la "
"verifiquen (su identidad no se incluye). Una vez que haga esto, deberá "
"volver a cifrar sus opciones y obtener un nuevo código de seguimiento. Esto "
"ayuda a reducir la posibilidad de que alguien lo coaccione para votar de "
"forma distinta a su verdadera elección."

#: helios/templates/election_audited_ballots.html:13
msgid ""
"These ballots are <em>not cast</em>, and they will not be counted. They are "
"just here for auditing purposes, to spot-check that Helios is properly "
"encrypting voter's choices."
msgstr ""
"Estas papeletas <em>no han sido emitidas</em> y no serán contabilizadas. "
"Están aquí únicamente con fines de auditoría, para verificar que Helios está "
"cifrando correctamente las opciones de los votantes."

#: helios/templates/election_audited_ballots.html:19
#, python-format
msgid ""
"To verify an audited ballot, copy its entire content and paste it in the <a "
"target=\"_new\" href=\"/booth/single-ballot-verify.html?"
"election_url=%(election_home_url)s&lang=%(LANGUAGE_CODE)s\">single ballot "
"verifier</a>."
msgstr ""
"Para verificar una papeleta auditada, copie todo su contenido y péguelo en "
"el <a target=\"_new\" href=\"/booth/single-ballot-verify.html?"
"election_url=%(election_home_url)s&lang=%(LANGUAGE_CODE)s\">verificador de "
"papeleta individual</a>."

#: helios/templates/election_audited_ballots.html:24
