#: helios/templates/list_trustees.html:4
#, python-format
msgid "Trustees for %(election_name)s"
msgstr "Fiduciarios de %(election_name)s"

#: helios/templates/list_trustees.html:13
msgid "Trustees"
msgstr "Fiduciarios"

#: helios/templates/list_trustees.html:19
msgid ""
"Trustees are responsible for decrypting the election result.<br />\n"
"    Each trustee generates a keypair and submits the public portion to "
"Helios.<br />\n"
"    When it's time to decrypt, each trustee needs to provide their secret "
"key."
msgstr ""
"Los fiduciarios son responsables de descifrar el resultado de la elección."
"<br />\n"
"    Cada fiduciario genera un par de claves y envía la parte pública a "
"Helios.<br />\n"
"    Cuando llega el momento de descifrar, cada fiduciario debe proporcionar "
"su clave secreta."

#: helios/templates/list_trustees.html:27
msgid ""
"Helios is automatically your first trustee and will handle its keypair "
"generation and decryption automatically.<br />\n"
"  You may add additional trustees if you want, and you can even remove the "
"Helios trustee.<br />\n"
"  However, we recommend you do this only if you have a solid understanding "
"of the trustee's role."
msgstr ""
"Helios es automáticamente su primer fiduciario y gestionará la generación de "
"su par de claves y el descifrado de forma automática.<br />\n"
"  Puede agregar fiduciarios adicionales si lo desea, e incluso puede "
"eliminar al fiduciario Helios.<br />\n"
"  Sin embargo, le recomendamos hacerlo solo si comprende bien el rol del "
"fiduciario."

#: helios/templates/list_trustees.html:34
