msgid "Cookies are required for Helios use"
msgstr "Las cookies son necesarias para usar Helios"

#: helios/templates/nocookies.html:7
msgid "Cookies are Required for Helios"
msgstr "Las cookies son necesarias para Helios"

#: helios/templates/nocookies.html:10
#, python-format
msgid ""
"It appears your browser does not support cookies or is set up to block "
"cookies from this site. Helios needs to set a session cookie so that it can "
"save your vote, let you log in, etc. Enable cookies and then <a "
"href=\"%(retest_url)s\">proceed to preparing your ballot</a>"
msgstr ""
"Parece que su navegador no admite cookies o está configurado para bloquear "
"las cookies de este sitio. Helios necesita establecer una cookie de sesión "
"para poder guardar su voto, permitirle iniciar sesión, etc. Habilite las "
"cookies y luego <a href=\"%(retest_url)s\">continúe con la preparación de su "
"papeleta</a>"

#: helios/templates/nocookies.html:13
msgid ""
"If you keep getting sent back to this page, it's probably because you "
"haven't enabled cookies successfully."
msgstr ""
"Si sigue siendo redirigido a esta página, probablemente sea porque no ha "
"habilitado las cookies correctamente."

